      "type": "telegram",
      "headline": "Largest U.S. Retail Brokerage Charles Schwab Adds Spot Trading for SOL, AVAX and LINK Charles Schwab, the largest U.S. retail brokerage, announced on November 9 that its Schwab Crypto platform has added spot trading for Solana (SOL), Avalanche (AVAX), and Chainlink (LINK), bringing its supported assets to five alongside BTC and ETH. The platform launched early access in May and opened to all eligible retail clients in October, charging a 0.75% trading fee. The service is currently available only to eligible customers in select U.S. states, excluding New York and Louisiana, and is not available outside the United States. — link",
